{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate-history 2005, the forgotten \u201980s platformer <i>Cocoboy</i> has re-entered the spotlight, sparking the rise of a  niche community of passionate fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/1b91d7dbce4570f9e5620306e0e12b0c.webp?t=1770008571\" alt=\"MODIFY, BRUTE FORCE, &amp;amp; RESTORE an 80&#039;s cult classic.\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.poster.avif?t=1770008571\" width=810 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.webm?t=1770008571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.mp4?t=1770008571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Cocoboy like never before with <strong>Modcarts</strong>\u2014cartridge-like devices hacked together by tech-savvy community members. Discover clever combinations of mods to progress, uncover tricky secrets, and even break level design in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/88d40606fbdce44c5b23d49f539d4b45.webp?t=1770008571\" alt=\"COLLECT and DECORATE with rare merchandise.\" width=600 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/c5b5937d54584470b052ed11c1b040f4.poster.avif?t=1770008571\" width=810 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/c5b5937d54584470b052ed11c1b040f4.webm?t=1770008571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/c5b5937d54584470b052ed11c1b040f4.mp4?t=1770008571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a break from the platforming action? Take a breather and decorate your  bedroom with rare pieces of Cocoboy memorabilia. Discover merchandise from a game franchise thought to be lost to time... and buy them with coins you find throughout its levels! Who knows... maybe these artifacts can even guide you to secrets in the game itself..?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/ced24054c5a1e3b40f3611854cd8e45c.webp?t=1770008571\" alt=\"IMMERSE in a new and peculiar fandom.\" width=600 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the online Cocoboy Forums and experience a community growing in real-time as you play. Check discussion threads for game tips, hints, rumors, theories, and arguments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/3f9dc4c43d9c28b01388ac95858bff5c.webp?t=1770008571\" alt=\"Featuring...\" width=600 height=61 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard &amp; Mouse, Controller, and Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several unlockable Modcart abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless merchandise to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack blending classic chiptune and live-recorded acoustics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and an original 80s cartoon with a functional VHS player?!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/90b64a8190331f4986554d11b54212f4.webp?t=1770008571\" alt=\"Development\" width=600 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prototype  version was originally developed in one week for Vinesauce's Shroomjam 2024. After seeing how much the original game resonated, we decided to continue development and make COCOBOY a full game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589190?t=1770008571","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/17a4ffdbc8baef71d65505ab7baf694edddc4b3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770008571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/5938b17814154a7efe56323127fdf21cd0663220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770008571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/5938b17814154a7efe56323127fdf21cd0663220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770008571","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3864040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate-history 2005, the forgotten \u201980s platformer <i>Cocoboy</i> has re-entered the spotlight, sparking the rise of a  niche community of passionate fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/1b91d7dbce4570f9e5620306e0e12b0c.webp?t=1770008571\" alt=\"MODIFY, BRUTE FORCE, &amp;amp; RESTORE an 80&#039;s cult classic.\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.poster.avif?t=1770008571\" width=810 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.webm?t=1770008571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/2a964745ce32ddf586bfe60d1420020d.mp4?t=1770008571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Cocoboy like never before with <strong>Modcarts</strong>\u2014cartridge-like devices hacked together by tech-savvy community members. Discover clever combinations of mods to progress, uncover tricky secrets, and even break level design in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589190/extras/88d40606fbdce44c5b23d49f539d4b45.webp?t=1770008571\" alt=\"COLLECT and DECORATE with rare merchandise.\" width=600 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla